nk:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"3590\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-66\" x=\"4090\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-70\" x=\"4647\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-65\" x=\"5203\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6E\" x=\"5648\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-74\" x=\"6204\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-61\" x=\"6594\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-67\" x=\"7094\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"7595\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6E\" x=\"8095\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-73\" x=\"8652\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3A\" x=\"9324\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(9880,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-74\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"389\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-74\" x=\"890\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-61\" x=\"1279\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6C\" x=\"1780\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6E\" x=\"2308\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-75\" x=\"2865\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6D\" x=\"3421\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-62\" x=\"4255\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-65\" x=\"4811\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-72\" x=\"5256\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"5898\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-66\" x=\"6399\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-73\" x=\"6955\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-68\" x=\"7350\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-61\" x=\"7906\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-70\" x=\"8407\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-65\" x=\"8963\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-73\" x=\"9408\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>To find this ratio, we start by counting the number of occurrences of each shape:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>First, we count the number of pentagons. There are <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.162ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 500.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">3</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-33\" d=\"M127 463Q100 463 85 480T69 524Q69 579 117 622T233 665Q268 665 277 664Q351 652 390 611T430 522Q430 470 396 421T302 350L299 348Q299 347 308 345T337 336T375 315Q457 262 457 175Q457 96 395 37T238 -22Q158 -22 100 21T42 130Q42 158 60 175T105 193Q133 193 151 175T169 130Q169 119 166 110T159 94T148 82T136 74T126 70T118 67L114 66Q165 21 238 21Q293 21 321 74Q338 107 338 175V195Q338 290 274 322Q259 328 213 329L171 330L168 332Q166 335 166 348Q166 366 174 366Q202 366 232 371Q266 376 294 413T322 525V533Q322 590 287 612Q265 626 240 626Q208 626 181 615T143 592T132 580H135Q138 579 143 578T153 573T165 566T175 555T183 540T186 520Q186 498 172 481T127 463Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> pentagons.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Next, we count the total number of shapes. There are <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.162ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 500.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">6</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-36\" d=\"M42 313Q42 476 123 571T303 666Q372 666 402 630T432 550Q432 525 418 510T379 495Q356 495 341 509T326 548Q326 592 373 601Q351 623 311 626Q240 626 194 566Q147 500 147 364L148 360Q153 366 156 373Q197 433 263 433H267Q313 433 348 414Q372 400 396 374T435 317Q456 268 456 210V192Q456 169 451 149Q440 90 387 34T253 -22Q225 -22 199 -14T143 16T92 75T56 172T42 313ZM257 397Q227 397 205 380T171 335T154 278T148 216Q148 133 160 97T198 39Q222 21 251 21Q302 21 329 59Q342 77 347 104T352 209Q352 289 347 316T329 361Q302 397 257 397Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> shapes.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the ratio of pentagons to total shapes is <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"4.909ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 2113.6 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">3:6.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-33\" d=\"M127 463Q100 463 85 480T69 524Q69 579 117 622T233 665Q268 665 277 664Q351 652 390 611T430 522Q430 470 396 421T302 350L299 348Q299 347 308 345T337 336T375 315Q457 262 457 175Q457 96 395 37T238 -22Q158 -22 100 21T42 130Q42 158 60 175T105 193Q133 193 151 175T169 130Q169 119 166 110T159 94T148 82T136 74T126 70T118 67L114 66Q165 21 238 21Q293 21 321 74Q338 107 338 175V195Q338 290 274 322Q259 328 213 329L171 330L168 332Q166 335 166 348Q166 366 174 366Q202 366 232 371Q266 376 294 413T322 525V533Q322 590 287 612Q265 626 240 626Q208 626 181 615T143 592T132 580H135Q138 579 143 578T153 573T165 566T175 555T183 540T186 520Q186 498 172 481T127 463Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-3A\" d=\"M78 370Q78 394 95 412T138 430Q162 430 180 414T199 371Q199 346 182 328T139 310T96 327T78 370ZM78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T